"TOTP obligatwa pou karakteristik sa a fonksyone. Ajoute kontak anba a epi "
"mete fraz deklanche sekrè yo. Modèl egzanp: 'SEKRÈ TOTP' Egzanp lavi reyèl: "
"'Gorilla 123456'"

#: src/telephony/client/ui/windows/trusted_actions_list_window.py:164
msgid ""
"Trusted contacts can silently trigger a callback by sending a secret SMS "
"message. TOTP is mandatory for this feature to work. Add contacts below and "
"set their secret trigger phrase. Example template: 'SECRET TOTP' Real life "
"example: 'Gorilla 123456'"
msgstr ""
"Kontak ou fè konfyans yo ka deklanche an silans yon apèl lè yo voye yon "
"mesaj SMS sekrè. TOTP obligatwa pou karakteristik sa a fonksyone. Ajoute "
"kontak anba a epi mete fraz deklanche sekrè yo. Modèl egzanp: 'SEKRÈ TOTP' "
"Egzanp lavi reyèl: 'Gorilla 123456'"

#: src/telephony/client/ui/windows/trusted_actions_list_window.py:167
msgid ""
"Trusted contacts can send an SMS relay. TOTP is mandatory for this feature "
"to work. Add contacts below and set their secret trigger phrase. Example "
"template: 'SECRET TOTP +1234567890 MESSAGE' Real life example: 'Gorilla "
"123456 +1234567890 Hello'"
msgstr ""
"Kontak ou fè konfyans yo ka voye yon relè SMS. TOTP obligatwa pou "
"karakteristik sa a fonksyone. Ajoute kontak anba a epi mete fraz deklanche "
"sekrè yo. Modèl egzanp: 'SEKRÈ TOTP +1234567890 MESAJ' Egzanp lavi reyèl: "
"'Gorilla 123456 +1234567890 Bonjou'"

#: src/telephony/client/ui/windows/trusted_actions_list_window.py:170
msgid ""
"Trusted contacts can start a tmate SSH session and receive the SSH access "
"string by sending a secret SMS message. TOTP is mandatory for this feature "
"to work. Add contacts below and set their secret trigger phrase. Example "
"template: 'SECRET TOTP' Real life example: 'Gorilla 123456'"
msgstr ""
"Kontak fè konfyans yo ka kòmanse yon sesyon SSH tmate epi resevwa kòd aksè "
"SSH la lè yo voye yon mesaj SMS sekrè. TOTP obligatwa pou karakteristik sa a "
"fonksyone. Ajoute kontak anba a epi mete fraz deklanche sekrè yo. Modèl "
"egzanp: 'SEKRÈ TOTP' Egzanp lavi reyèl: 'Gorilla 123456'"

#: src/telephony/client/ui/windows/trusted_actions_list_window.py:173
msgid ""
"Trusted contacts can lock your device: the SIM PIN is changed to a new one "
"and locked, and the phone powers off. TOTP is mandatory for this feature to "
"work. Add contacts below and set their secret trigger phrase. Example "
"template: 'SECRET TOTP SIM_CURRENT_PIN SIM_NEW_PIN SUDO_PASSWORD' Real life "
"example: 'Gorilla 123456 0000 1234 SupportYourLocalFootball'"
msgstr ""
"Kontak ou fè konfyans ka bloke aparèy ou an: PIN SIM nan chanje pou yon "
"nouvo epi li bloke, epi telefòn nan etenn. TOTP obligatwa pou karakteristik "
"sa a fonksyone. Ajoute kontak anba a epi mete fraz deklanche sekrè yo. Modèl "
"egzanp: 'SEKRÈ TOTP SIM_KOURAN_PIN SIM_NOUVO_PIN MODPAS_SUDO' Egzanp lavi "
"reyèl: 'Gorilla 123456 0000 1234 SupportYourLocalFootball'"

